WEBVTT

NOTE
Audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2
File: disc02_17h.avi
Scene: Squall reaches the Memorial or breaks Rinoa free
Duration: approximately 6 seconds
Describes a dramatic transitional moment of rescue and defiance.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Squall reaches the crystalline chamber. He places his hands against the sealed tomb holding Rinoa. His jaw clenches.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The crystal structure shatters under some force — whether Squall's gunblade, Lion Heart's power, or sheer will, the containment is breached. Rinoa is freed. The moment of her liberation is at hand.